<!--
    The themed-icon (monochrome) layer: the same raven silhouette in a single
    flat colour. Android 13+ / 14+ tints this to the user's wallpaper palette, so
    the shape has to be flat and self-contained - no colours, no eye fill.

    Scaled by the group so the bird stays inside the 66dp safe circle after the
    launcher crops the 108dp canvas to 72dp.
-->
